<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:33:06 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>你的免疫系统能像人工智能一样学习吗？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/does-your-immune-system-learn-like-ai</link><description>人工智能能否成为解答困扰医生和科学家数十年的问题的关键？冷泉港实验室 (CSHL) 最近的一项研究借鉴了机器学习的概念来解决免疫学的一个古老谜团。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/does-your-immune-system-learn-like-ai2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:33:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/does-your-immune-system-learn-like-ai</guid></item><item><title>如果我们发现外星生命，接下来会发生什么？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/if-we-discover-extraterrestrial-life-what-happens-next</link><description>随着各国政府和美国宇航局积极调查不明异常现象，对外星生命的搜寻已经从哲学发展成为严重的科学和国家安全问题。虽然发现外星智慧可能引发科学复兴，带来医学、能源和技术方面的进步，但它也带来了前所未有的安全挑战。不同层次的发现，从生物特征到直接接触，都会带来不同的社会破坏。风险包括潜在的敌意、通过深度伪造进行的信息战，以及有关所有权和联系控制的复杂地缘政治问题。因此，人类需要一个用于验证、协调和复原力的全球框架来应对这一重大事件。战略问题不仅仅是我们是否孤军奋战，而是我们是否真正做好了应对答案的深远影响的准备。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/if-we-discover-extraterrestrial-life-what-happens-next.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:18:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/if-we-discover-extraterrestrial-life-what-happens-next</guid></item><item><title>白宫将数据中心、电池和 AR 从美国关键技术清单中删除，新增集成光子学、高熵合金</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/white-house-cuts-data-centers-batteries-and-ar-from-the-us-critical-technology-list-integrated-photonics-high-entropy-alloys-among-new-additions</link><description>这是自 2024 年以来联邦关键技术清单的首次重写。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/white-house-cuts-data-centers-batteries-and-ar-from-the-us-critical-technology-list-integrated-photonics-high-entropy-alloys-among-new-additions.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:03:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/white-house-cuts-data-centers-batteries-and-ar-from-the-us-critical-technology-list-integrated-photonics-high-entropy-alloys-among-new-additions</guid></item><item><title>来认识一下伊利诺伊州学生扎伊纳布·纳萨尼 (Zainab Nathani)，他设计了一种可以利用阳光从潮湿空气中提取水的材料</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/meet-zainab-nathani-the-illinois-student-who-designed-a-material-that-can-pull-water-from-humid-air-using-sunlight</link><description>来自伊利诺伊州奈尔斯的高中三年级学生扎伊纳布·纳萨尼 (Zainab Nathani) 设计了一种完全由阳光驱动的材料，可以直接从潮湿的空气中提取饮用水。她在尼尔斯镇西高中学习时，围绕乳液模板复合生物凝胶构建了自己的项目，这种多孔生物基结构旨在捕获大气中的水分，并在自然阳光加热后以液态水的形式释放出来，无需电力或额外能源。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/meet-zainab-nathani-the-illinois-student-who-designed-a-material-that-can-pull-water-from-humid-air-using-sunlight2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 23:48:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/meet-zainab-nathani-the-illinois-student-who-designed-a-material-that-can-pull-water-from-humid-air-using-sunlight</guid></item><item><title>狗评估的不仅仅是人的姿势</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/dogs-assess-more-than-a-persons-posture</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 23:33:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/dogs-assess-more-than-a-persons-posture</guid></item><item><title>NASA 的蜻蜓旋翼机将于 2028 年 7 月搭载 SpaceX 猎鹰重型火箭发射升空，并用六年半的时间穿越太阳系，降落在有天气的月球上</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nasas-dragonfly-rotorcraft-will-launch-on-a-spacex-falcon-heavy-in-july-2028-and-spend-six-and-a-half-years-crossing-the-solar-system-to-land-on-a-moon-that-has-weather</link><description>蜻蜓计划于 2028 年 7 月发射，开启为期六年半的土卫六之旅，在那里的核动力飞行实验室将比较有机沙丘、天气和撞击地形。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nasas-dragonfly-rotorcraft-will-launch-on-a-spacex-falcon-heavy-in-july-2028-and-spend-six-and-a-half-years-crossing-the-solar-system-to-land-on-a-moon-that-has-weather.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 23:18:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nasas-dragonfly-rotorcraft-will-launch-on-a-spacex-falcon-heavy-in-july-2028-and-spend-six-and-a-half-years-crossing-the-solar-system-to-land-on-a-moon-that-has-weather</guid></item><item><title>拯救你的屁股！</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/saving-your-butts</link><description>男士高级 T 恤？ ⭐ 女士高级 T 恤 ❗ 儿童高级 T 恤&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/saving-your-butts2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 23:03:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/saving-your-butts</guid></item><item><title>合成机器人训练数据：40% 的门槛削弱了十亿美元的竞赛</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/synthetic-robot-training-data-the-40-threshold-undercutting-a-billiondollar-race</link><description>卡内基梅隆大学和斯坦福大学的研究团队独立发现，仅在 40% 合成数据上训练的视觉语言动作机器人策略与在 100% 真实世界演示上训练的策略的性能相匹配。这一结果削弱了数十亿机器人资金背后的假设：拥有庞大的现实世界数据收集舰队是主要的竞争护城河。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/synthetic-robot-training-data-the-40-threshold-undercutting-a-billiondollar-race.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 22:48:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/synthetic-robot-training-data-the-40-threshold-undercutting-a-billiondollar-race</guid></item><item><title>随着使用量的飙升，人工智能代理预计将增加技术现金流</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ai-agents-forecast-to-boost-tech-cash-flow-as-usage-soars</link><description>对 Agentic AI 的需求预计将飙升，同时超大规模企业的成本正在下降，这为提高毛利率和重新审视该行业的可持续性奠定了基础。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-agents-forecast-to-boost-tech-cash-flow-as-usage-soars.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 22:33:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ai-agents-forecast-to-boost-tech-cash-flow-as-usage-soars</guid></item><item><title>革命性的干细胞疗法必须负责任地进行才能充分发挥其潜力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-revolutionary-stemcell-therapy-must-proceed-responsibly-to-achieve-its-full-potential</link><description>诱导多能干细胞震撼生物医学已有20年了。既然临床试验正在顺利进行，就必须保持公众的信任。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-revolutionary-stemcell-therapy-must-proceed-responsibly-to-achieve-its-full-potential.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 22:18:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-revolutionary-stemcell-therapy-must-proceed-responsibly-to-achieve-its-full-potential</guid></item></channel></rss>